<font size=5>Education/Public Information</font>
<br>
<b>UI Eco-Hydraulics Group and LRK Communications (LRK)</b>
<p>
The UI met and discussed with Mary Beth Funk (Communities Creating Connections, Annenberg Rural Challenge Grant for Kooskia and Elk City) an opportunity to collaborate on a NSF grant proposal.
<p>
UI also contacted Kit Friedenburg of the Idaho Fish and Wildlife Foundation regarding sources of funding to enhance the educational facilities at Red River WMA.  A pre-proposal was prepared for Kit to show to potential funding sources.
<p>
Our web page has been updated to include the <a href="1998-06_1.asp">June Newsletter</a> and <a href="/redriver/facts.asp">FACT sheet</a>.  Subsequent newsletters will also be posted.  <a href="mailto:jabbott@uidaho.edu">Jason Abbott</a> (UI) maintains our web site.  We appreciate his efforts!  Check it out if you haven't already:
